/member/26513-laguz-24","name":"Laguz 24","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26513_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-14T14:24:10-08:00","id":1435480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laguz 24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1401339-how-do-you-stat-out-the-millennium-items-from-yugioh?p=1435387#post1435387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Millennium eye. Being able to read the surface thoughts (aka telepathy merit level 3) Curse: Your visions leave your judgement clouded, whenever you have to roll to resist indulging in a vice, take a -3 penalty to avoid doing so.</div> </div> </div> </div>Obviously should be considered an amulet in Mummy terms, as I think most of the items in that series would be (the other typical one being effigies).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-15T02:27:53-08:00","id":1435531,"title":"","content":"Perhaps a power all millennium items have is the ability to activate the Shadow Games, activating a special set of collectible trading cards to be able to summon Fiends to battle in a parallel world/dreamstate/neter kertet/ duat, with the stakes potentially involving your Pillars, Sekhem, or Soul entirely. While the cards themselves (each depicting an environment within neter kertet, an utterance unique to the game, an affinity, a relic, a curse/trap, or a friend) can be used in mundane games, it would require the use of a millennium items to fuel the actual Shadow Games tournaments. The Fiends and situations of the duel don't affect material reality (much like the magi's duel arcane), but can have eternal and very real consequences on players.<br /> <br /> Of course, not that anyone remembers, but the Fiends depicted on the cards ARE Fiends that you can find in Duat, if you travel there, and CAN find their way into Twilight or the material world. Most would be summoners would have to have Sorcery to actually summon a real fiend into reality, and as such can only likely summon a handful of such entities at best. The Arisen are unlikely to be able to summon them, though they can certainly participate in the Shadow Games, and possess several distinct advantages (being unable to have their soul violated, having the kepher to find a millennium item, replenshable Sekhem).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-15T13:23:33-08:00","id":1435583,"title":"","content":"Try looking at the huckster immortal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26513-laguz-24","name":"Laguz 24","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26513_2.png","title":"Member